bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Verify Email Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService

User -> UI: 1. Click verification link in email
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/verify-email (code)
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. verificationEmail(code)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. verificationEmail(token)
activate AuthService

AuthService -> AuthService: 5. Check token
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

opt Invalid token
    AuthService --> AuthController: 5.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 5.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 5.4. Missing verification token
end

ref over AuthService: 3.4.b.i. Subsequence - Find User for Email Verification

AuthService -> AuthService: 6. Check user
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

loop User not found or banned / User already verified / Code mismatch
    AuthService --> AuthController: 6.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 6.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 6.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 6.4. User invalid
end

ref over AuthService: 3.4.b.ii. Subsequence - Update Verified Status

AuthService -> AuthService: 7. Check update
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

opt Update verification failed
    AuthService --> AuthController: 7.1. Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 7.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 7.3. Show error
    UI --> User: 7.4. Verification failed
end

AuthService --> AuthController: 8. Return success message
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 9. HTTP 200 response
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 10. Verification success
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 11. Redirect to login page
deactivate UI
deactivate User